JARVIS ANALYSIS

Current architecture already contains the components needed:

AYRE      = Discovery
ERIS      = Entropy Filter
ATHENA    = Classification
MNEMOS    = Semantic Storage
MIMIR     = Knowledge Graph
HADES     = Immutable Log
ODIN      = Routing

Auto-ingest does not require a new god system.

Gold Law compliance suggests implementing it as a pipeline using existing systems rather than introducing another abstraction layer.

Primary risk:

Knowledge Growth > Governance Capacity

If ingestion exceeds validation throughput, memory quality degrades.

Recommended invariant:

No autonomous write
without validation path


