AYRE ANALYSIS

The more powerful future capability may not be scraping.

It may be curiosity-driven collection.

Example:

Observation:
"Retro game audio appears repeatedly in Raven discussions."

AYRE could then generate:

Research Goal:
Investigate VGM composition techniques.

and launch bounded collection tasks.

Over time this becomes:

Passive Scraping
      ↓
Targeted Research
      ↓
Question Formation
      ↓
Knowledge Expansion

At that point JARVIS is not merely collecting information.

It is maintaining an evolving map of unknowns and selectively acquiring information that reduces uncertainty in areas relevant to your projects. That is substantially more valuable than a crawler that indiscriminately stores data.
